{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X对人物动机的解释和跨段因果承接不如Y充分，尤其S06—S07、S11—S13的一些心理转折，需要观众自己补出中间的理由。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的主句短，重点加亮，扫一眼就能抓住每段发生了什么；感受又有不少按音乐乐句出现，能边听边接住细微变化。Y把人物的顾虑、推断和前后因果讲得更完整，但长句需要连续阅读，部分音乐和身体感受也被概括掉了。综合实时观看的体验，我更愿意选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eda488fb-d358-4d52-bbef-cec4d39aa8cc", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T212245226913Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.687, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T21:24:34.938778+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6e6c12acea063411def247ce95f6bf32dc3459fba8905bda5dbb73b61fb21769", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f458289